SPC0002 is an independent community derivative of FAGCI MOD v1.2.1.
Original source attribution includes fagci, Dual Tachyon, OneOfEleven,
and the other contributors credited in upstream source files and documentation.
Their original notices remain authoritative and are retained.

Egzumer 0.22 was used for comparison and supplied the local archive from
which missing ARM CMSIS_5 and mpaland/printf dependency files were recovered.
The Egzumer AM controller has not been ported into SPC0002.

This community fork is not an official FAGCI, Egzumer, or Quansheng release.
These project names describe provenance and do not imply endorsement.

AMH0004 experimental modifications, 2026-10-14: normal AM RX fixed-slot hardware AGC integration and Spectrum automatic-AGC boundary handling. FAGCI AM-fix controller and gain table remain unchanged.

SOS0005 modifications, 2026-10-14: replace flashlight blinking with scheduler-driven Morse SOS. Original authors and license notices retained.

RXP0006 modifications, 2026-10-14: explicit Spectrum manual RX profiles, persistence/reload, AGC isolation, and build-size optimization. Original authors/licenses retained.
